{"title":"Vocabulary competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"US_vocabulary_competitions\">US vocabulary competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vocabulary_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: US vocabulary competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Middle_school\">Middle school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vocabulary_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Middle school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Reader%27s_Digest_National_Word_Power_Challenge\" title=\"Reader&#39;s Digest National Word Power Challenge\"> Word Power Challenge</a> The premier vocabulary competition, for 6-8th grades. Over 3 million students participate each year. Two AoPS users have won a total of $40,000 at this competition. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://nwpc.rd.com\">Sign up today!</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vocabulary_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spelling_competitions\" title=\"Spelling competitions\">Spelling competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">Academic competitions</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"